ommands.\",\n        \"source\": \"Industry Reports\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"Multiple reports about Cursor having too many bugs. Performance issues with large codebases (can be slow or freeze).\",\n        \"source\": \"User Reviews\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"negative\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"Model Controls, Spend Management, and Usage Analytics\",\n    \"description\": \"Enterprise admins get model access controls with granular allow/blocklists, soft spend limits with intelligent alerts, updated usage analytics tab filtering, and team marketplace updates.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.com/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-06\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"Cursor Security Review Beta\",\n    \"description\": \"Cursor Security Review now in beta on Teams and Enterprise plans with Security Reviewer (checks PRs for vulnerabilities) and Vulnerability Scanner (scheduled scans of codebase). Customizable security agents.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"announcement\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.com/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-06\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Aider\",\n    \"title\": \"Aider v0.56.0\",\n    \"description\": \"Enables prompt caching for Sonnet via OpenRouter, 8k output tokens for Sonnet via VertexAI and DeepSeek V2.5, new /report command for GitHub Issues, --chat-language switch, and numerous bug fixes.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/paul-gauthier/aider/releases\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-05\",\n    \"community_feedback\": [\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"There's a GitHub issue (#1507) about Windows installation difficulties with Aider v0.56.0\",\n        \"source\": \"GitHub Issues\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"neutral\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n  